  caseIndex: 0
  caseSender: Cory Caldeen
  caseSubject: I find a treasure room
  caseBody: 'The Case:

    My team and I found this strange, sealed room deep in
    the mine. The moment the seal was broken, the opening was filled with an absolute
    unnatural void that shouldn''t exist. I need to get out of this mine alive to
    be able to provide for my wife and my son, Adrian. Please identify what force
    we have unleashed.'
